<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins $2.00 higher; butts unevenly steady; skinned hams 17-20 lbs steady to 1.00 lower, 20-26 lbs 2.00-3.00 lower; seedless bellies steady to 1.00 higher; lean trimmings steady to 2.00 lower.</p>
<p>Trading moderate, with moderate retail demand and light to moderate retail offerings, and moderate processing demand and heavy ham offerings.  - USDA</p>
